{"text": "El carpintero Gepeto talló un muñeco de madera y lo llamó Pinocho. Aquella noche, un hada le dio movimiento y voz. Gepeto se alegró al verlo caminar y decidió cuidarlo como a un hijo. Gepeto: Aprenderemos muchas cosas juntos.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.330624, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.345375, "end": 1.069041, "from": 3, "to": 13}, {"start": 1.083791, "end": 1.615457, "from": 14, "to": 20}, {"start": 1.630208, "end": 1.969874, "from": 21, "to": 26}, {"start": 1.984666, "end": 2.132332, "from": 27, "to": 29}, {"start": 2.147125, "end": 2.678791, "from": 30, "to": 36}, {"start": 2.693541, "end": 2.796916, "from": 37, "to": 39}, {"start": 2.811708, "end": 3.328583, "from": 40, "to": 46}, {"start": 3.343375, "end": 3.44675, "from": 47, "to": 48}, {"start": 3.4615, "end": 3.594416, "from": 49, "to": 51}, {"start": 3.609208, "end": 3.963666, "from": 52, "to": 57}, {"start": 3.978416, "end": 4.642999, "from": 58, "to": 65}, {"start": 5.671083, "end": 6.158458, "from": 67, "to": 74}, {"start": 6.173208, "end": 6.660583, "from": 75, "to": 80}, {"start": 7.044541, "end": 7.177457, "from": 82, "to": 84}, {"start": 7.192208, "end": 7.413749, "from": 85, "to": 89}, {"start": 7.4285, "end": 7.561416, "from": 90, "to": 92}, {"start": 7.576208, "end": 7.797749, "from": 93, "to": 96}, {"start": 7.8125, "end": 8.521375, "from": 97, "to": 107}, {"start": 8.536166, "end": 8.595249, "from": 108, "to": 109}, {"start": 8.61, "end": 9.126875, "from": 110, "to": 113}, {"start": 10.145916, "end": 10.692332, "from": 115, "to": 121}, {"start": 10.707125, "end": 10.840041, "from": 122, "to": 124}, {"start": 10.854791, "end": 11.253541, "from": 125, "to": 131}, {"start": 11.268333, "end": 11.401249, "from": 132, "to": 134}, {"start": 11.416, "end": 11.770458, "from": 135, "to": 140}, {"start": 11.785208, "end": 12.302083, "from": 141, "to": 148}, {"start": 12.316875, "end": 12.375958, "from": 149, "to": 150}, {"start": 12.390708, "end": 12.981458, "from": 151, "to"